+ * (:1110-1321: common regs with the lane enable, data-rate regs, the 37 3-phase regs of each of the 3 trios,
+ * irq config), release from reset (3-phase: 0x1000 = 0x0e, then 3048 us), trio status (:2431-2451).
+ * Settle count: config_dev computes settle_time / 200000000 from the userland value; this file takes the
+ * count from the module file (mode 1, 4000x3008, settle 52, out/camera/modules.txt) as the count itself [I:
+ * the D-PHY modules give 26-40, which as a 300-400 MHz timer count is inside the MIPI THS-SETTLE window
+ * (85 ns + 6 UI .. 145 ns + 10 UI), so the module value is a count, not ns].
+ * Data rate [I]: IMX789 FTM PLL (cam_sensor_settings.h:6017-6141) IOP 19.2 / 2 (0x030d) x 343 (0x030e/f) =
